{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011smGnsGpPwRtXkPFLhvwUV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"K*=2 universality 从 '10 conditions, 4 families, 1B-7B' 升级为 '18 conditions, 6 families, 1B-8B'。LLaMA-8B 和 Mistral-7B 的加入直接消解 Reviewer concern #1（小模型外推），Pythia decoding ablation 证明解码不变性跨模型成立，length ablation 排除文本长度混淆，cross-scorer matrix 确认 scorer independence。C1' 措辞升级为 'demonstrating universality across 6 architecture families at 1B-8B scale'。EMNLP Main 高置信投稿。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-018\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9587\n        1v2: 0.6341\n        2v3: 0.5523\n        3v4: 0.5198\n        4v5: 0.5072\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0041\n        1v2: 0.0088\n        2v3: 0.0055\n        3v4: 0.0097\n        4v5: 0.0063\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9587, ci_lower: 0.9551, ci_upper: 0.9621, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6341, ci_lower: 0.6253, ci_upper: 0.6428, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5523, ci_lower: 0.5419, ci_upper: 0.5627, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5198, ci_lower: 0.5092, ci_upper: 0.5303, perm_p: 0.0003}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5072, ci_lower: 0.4968, ci_upper: 0.5178, perm_p: 0.0891}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.118934\n        1v2: 0.011287\n        2v3: 0.005102\n        3v4: 0.004213\n        4v5: 0.003089\n      ordinal_mae: 1.1982\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3587\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_mean, surp_d1_skew]\n      n_samples: 30000\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: |\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA 和 RoPE，架构与 Qwen2.5 系同属 decoder-only transformer 但训练数据和 tokenizer 差异显著。\n      1v2 AUC=0.6341 处于 best 档 [0.615, 0.655] 中偏上位置，理由：\n      (1) 8B 参数量使模型能更精确地复制输入分布，gen-1 与 gen-0 的统计距离缩小，但 DPI 信息损失仍可检测；\n      (2) Cross-scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 对 LLaMA 文本计算 surprisal 时，tokenizer 不匹配引入轻微噪声，\n          但这仅增加方差（std=0.0088）而非系统性偏差——exp-004 (Qwen-7B, 同一 scorer) 给出 0.6178，\n          LLaMA-8B 稍高是因为 LLaMA 的 BPE 与 Qwen scorer 的 token boundary 不完全对齐，\n          跨 tokenizer 的 surprisal 分布差异恰好放大了 depth-dependent 特征的区分度；\n      (3) 0v1 AUC=0.9587 略低于 Qwen-7B 的 0.9644，原因同上——cross-tokenizer 噪声使 binary detection 微降，\n          但仍远高于 θ=0.60；\n      (4) 2v3 CI upper=0.5627 < 0.60，K*=2 边界清晰，不像 Qwen-cont 那样边缘；\n      (5) 4v5 pair perm_p=0.0891 > 0.05，与 exp-004 模式一致（深代际趋向随机）。\n      总结：LLaMA-8B 作为第 5 个架构族在 8B 规模确认 K*=2，CI lower=0.6253 距 θ=0.60 有 +2.5pp margin，\n      比 Qwen-cont (0.6015, +0.15pp) 稳健得多，直接强化 universality claim。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap 95% CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, AUC, CI_lower, CI_upper, perm_p, K_star_pass]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9587, 0.9551, 0.9621, \"<0.001\", \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6341, 0.6253, 0.6428, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_lower > 0.60\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5523, 0.5419, 0.5627, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_upper < 0.60\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5198, 0.5092, 0.5303, \"<0.001\", \"—\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5072, 0.4968, 0.5178, \"0.089\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: LLaMA-8B 叠加在已有 5 模型曲线上，展示相同的 0v1→1v2 急剧衰减 + 2v3 以后 plateau 模式\"\n    analysis: |\n      LLaMA-8B 是论文中最大模型且来自 Meta 架构族（区别于 EleutherAI/AI2/Alibaba）。\n      K*=2 在 8B 的确认将 scale coverage 从 '1B-7B' 升级为 '1B-8B'，\n      architecture coverage 从 4 families 升级为 5 families。\n      CI lower=0.6253 提供了比 Qwen-7B (0.6079) 更充裕的 margin，\n      使得整体 universality claim 对 θ 选择更鲁棒（即使 θ 上移到 0.62，LLaMA-8B 仍然 pass）。\n      Cross-tokenizer scorer 的成功也间接支持 exp-013 的 text-intrinsic signal 结论。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-019\"\n    description: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9612\n        1v2: 0.6278\n        2v3: 0.5489\n        3v4: 0.5167\n        4v5: 0.5054\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0038\n        1v2: 0.0076\n        2v3: 0.0048\n        3v4: 0.0102\n        4v5: 0.0071\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9612, ci_lower: 0.9578, ci_upper: 0.9645, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6278, ci_lower: 0.6195, ci_upper: 0.6362, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5489, ci_lower: 0.5387, ci_upper: 0.5591, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5167, ci_lower: 0.5059, ci_upper: 0.5274, perm_p: 0.0008}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5054, ci_lower: 0.4948, ci_upper: 0.5162, perm_p: 0.1243}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.121587\n        1v2: 0.010834\n        2v3: 0.004921\n        3v4: 0.003876\n        4v5: 0.002918\n      ordinal_mae: 1.2078\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3542\n      top_features: [surp_d1_std, freq_entropy, surp_std, surp_d1_mean, surp_skew]\n      n_samples: 30000\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096) + GQA，\n      与 LLaMA 的 full attention 和 Qwen 的 结构有本质差异。\n      1v2 AUC=0.6278 处于 best 档 [0.61, 0.645] 中部，略低于 LLaMA-8B (0.6341)，理由：\n      (1) Mistral 的 SWA 使长距离依赖信息在递归生成中的损失模式不同——\n          SWA 内的局部统计特征（surprisal 局部分布）在代际间退化稍快，\n          但全局特征（freq_entropy, ttr）退化模式与其他架构一致；\n      (2) Mistral 7B 参数量略少于 LLaMA 8B，信息保持能力的微小差异反映在 +0.63pp 的 AUC 差距；\n      (3) Cross-scorer tokenizer 效应与 LLaMA 类似但 Mistral 的 byte-fallback BPE \n          使 surprisal 计算的 token-boundary 差异更稳定，方差略低 (std=0.0076 vs 0.0088)；\n      (4) CI lower=0.6195 距 θ=0.60 有 +1.95pp margin，稳健通过；\n      (5) 2v3 CI upper=0.5591 < 0.60，K*=2 边界明确；\n      (6) 4v5 perm_p=0.1243，深代际不可分辨，与全部先前实验一致。\n      Mistral 作为第 6 个架构族（唯一的 SWA 架构），确认 K*=2 不依赖于 attention 机制选择，\n      进一步强化 \"architecture-invariant\" 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap 95% CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, AUC, CI_lower, CI_upper, perm_p, K_star_pass]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9612, 0.9578, 0.9645, \"<0.001\", \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6278, 0.6195, 0.6362, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_lower > 0.60\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5489, 0.5387, 0.5591, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_upper < 0.60\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5167, 0.5059, 0.5274, \"<0.001\", \"—\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5054, 0.4948, 0.5162, \"0.124\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"6-model AUC decay overlay: 所有 6 个模型族的 pairwise AUC 衰减曲线在同一图上，展示 1v2→2v3 处的 universal cliff\"\n    analysis: |\n      Mistral-7B 的 SWA 架构是唯一非 full-attention 模型。K*=2 在 SWA 下成立表明：\n      depth signal 的退化不依赖于模型如何 attend to 长距离 context，\n      而是 iterated generation 本身对局部统计量的 lossy compression 所致。\n      这与 DPI 框架完美一致——channel 的具体实现（SWA vs full attn）不影响信息损失的定性行为。\n      结合 LLaMA-8B，两个 7-8B 模型的一致结果使 reviewer concern #1 彻底失效。\n\n  - name: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      k_star_all_configs: true\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        config1_greedy:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9718, ci: [0.9691, 0.9744], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6482, ci: [0.6391, 0.6573], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5538, ci: [0.5441, 0.5635], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5189, ci: [0.5083, 0.5295], perm_p: 0.0002}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5098, ci: [0.4991, 0.5205], perm_p: 0.0312}\n        config2_nuc09:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9901, ci: [0.9886, 0.9916], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6512, ci: [0.6422, 0.6602], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5567, ci: [0.5469, 0.5665], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5201, ci: [0.5096, 0.5307], perm_p: 0.0001}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5112, ci: [0.5005, 0.5219], perm_p: 0.0198}\n        config3_t07:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9812, ci: [0.9789, 0.9835], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6498, ci: [0.6407, 0.6589], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5551, ci: [0.5453, 0.5649], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5178, ci: [0.5072, 0.5284], perm_p: 0.0003}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5134, ci: [0.5027, 0.5241], perm_p: 0.0087}\n        config4_t12:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9962, ci: [0.9953, 0.9970], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6671, ci: [0.6579, 0.6763], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5623, ci: [0.5524, 0.5722], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5215, ci: [0.5108, 0.5322], perm_p: 0.0001}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5147, ci: [0.5040, 0.5254], perm_p: 0.0052}\n      auc_1v2_range: [0.6482, 0.6671]\n      auc_1v2_spread: 0.0189\n      cross_decoding_feature_spearman: 0.87\n      method: \"GroupKFold(5) OOF + doc-level bootstrap + label permutation\"\n      resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: |\n      exp-003 在 Qwen2.5-1.5B 上已证明 4/4 decoding strategies K*=2，1v2 range=[0.6866, 0.7039]。\n      Pythia-1.4B 基准 1v2=0.6539 (nucleus p=0.95, exp-001)，预测 4 种解码的 1v2 range=[0.6482, 0.6671]：\n      (1) Greedy (0.6482): 确定性解码减少输出多样性，gen-1 更接近\"平均化\"的文本，\n          相比 nucleus 0.95 的 0.6539 略低，因为 greedy 的低熵输出使 surprisal 方差特征的区分度微降；\n      (2) Nucleus p=0.9 (0.6512): 接近 baseline 的 p=0.95，差异极小；\n      (3) T=0.7 (0.6498): 低温采样与 greedy 类似，轻微压缩分布尾部；\n      (4) T=1.2 (0.6671): 高温增加输出多样性，gen-1 文本的统计特征偏离更明显，\n          1v2 区分度升高——与 exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高 AUC (0.7039) 的模式完全一致；\n      (5) Range=0.0189 << Qwen 的 0.0173，说明 Pythia 对解码策略的敏感度与 Qwen 量级相当；\n      (6) 所有 4 个 config 的 CI lower 均 > 0.639，远高于 θ=0.60，margin 充裕；\n      (7) 所有 2v3 CI upper < 0.5722 < 0.60，K*=2 边界在所有 config 下清晰；\n      (8) Cross-decoding feature importance Spearman=0.87，高于 exp-003 中 Qwen 的\n          greedy vs T=1.2 的 0.53——Pythia 架构下特征排序对解码策略更稳定。\n      \n      关键意义：这证明 decoding invariance 不是 Qwen-specific 现象，而是跨模型成立的。\n      exp-003 (Qwen) + exp-020 (Pythia) 合计 8 个 decoding configurations 全部 K*=2。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Pythia-1.4B Decoding Ablation Summary\"\n        columns: [decoding, AUC_1v2, CI_lower, CI_upper, AUC_2v3, 2v3_CI_upper, K_star]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.6482, 0.6391, 0.6573, 0.5538, 0.5635, 2]\n          - [\"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6512, 0.6422, 0.6602, 0.5567, 0.5665, 2]\n          - [\"T=0.7\", 0.6498, 0.6407, 0.6589, 0.5551, 0.5649, 2]\n          - [\"T=1.2\", 0.6671, 0.6579, 0.6763, 0.5623, 0.5722, 2]\n      - title: \"Cross-model Decoding Invariance Comparison\"\n        columns: [model, decoding_configs, 1v2_range, range_width, all_K_star_2]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-1.5B (exp-003)\", 4, \"[0.6866, 0.7039]\", 0.0173, \"✅\"]\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B (exp-020)\", 4, \"[0.6482, 0.6671]\", 0.0189, \"✅\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双模型 decoding heatmap: Qwen (exp-003) 和 Pythia (exp-020) 各 4 decoding × 5 depth pairs 的 AUC，颜色编码展示两个模型的平行结构\"\n    analysis: |\n      Pythia 4/4 decoding configs K*=2 确认 decoding invariance 是跨模型的普遍现象。\n      论文 claim 从 \"4 decoding strategies (single model)\" 升级为 \"8 decoding configurations across 2 models\"。\n      T=1.2 在两个模型上都给出最高 1v2 AUC（Qwen 0.7039, Pythia 0.6671），\n      机制一致：高温采样放大 next-token 分布的尾部，使 gen-1 的 surprisal 分布特征更显著偏离 gen-0。\n      但即便如此，2v3 仍然 < 0.60——DPI 的信息饱和在 K*=2 处仍然成立。\n      Feature importance Spearman=0.87 (cross-decoding within Pythia) 高于 0.53 (cross-decoding within Qwen, exp-003)，\n      说明 Pythia 的特征排序对解码策略更稳定，可能因为 Pythia 架构更简单（无 GQA/RoPE enhancements）。\n\n  - name: \"Text length ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star_all_lengths: 2\n      results_by_length:\n        128_tokens:\n          k_star: 2\n          pairwise_auc:\n            0v1: 0.9823\n            1v2: 0.6187\n            2v3: 0.5512\n            3v4: 0.5298\n            4v5: 0.5089\n          bootstrap_ci:\n            1v2: {auc: 0.6187, ci_lower: 0.6089, ci_upper: 0.6285, perm_p: 0.0001}\n            2v3: {auc: 0.5512, ci_lower: 0.5411, ci_upper: 0.5613, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          ordinal_mae: 1.2134\n          ordinal_accuracy: 0.3612\n        256_tokens:\n          k_star: 2\n          pairwise_auc:\n            0v1: 0.9948\n            1v2: 0.6347\n            2v3: 0.5578\n            3v4: 0.5342\n            4v5: 0.5118\n          bootstrap_ci:\n            1v2: {auc: 0.6347, ci_lower: 0.6251, ci_upper: 0.6443, perm_p: 0.0001}\n            2v3: {auc: 0.5578, ci_lower: 0.5478, ci_upper: 0.5678, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          ordinal_mae: 1.1723\n          ordinal_accuracy: 0.3756\n        512_tokens:\n          k_star: 2\n          pairwise_auc:\n            0v1: 0.9981\n            1v2: 0.6523\n            2v3: 0.5641\n            3v4: 0.5378\n            4v5: 0.5145\n          bootstrap_ci:\n            1v2: {auc: 0.6523, ci_lower: 0.6428, ci_upper: 0.6618, perm_p: 0.0001}\n            2v3: {auc: 0.5641, ci_lower: 0.5542, ci_upper: 0.5740, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          ordinal_mae: 1.1389\n          ordinal_accuracy: 0.3891\n      auc_1v2_vs_length_spearman: 1.0\n      length_effect_per_doubling: \"+0.016 AUC per 2x tokens\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      文本长度影响特征估计的精度（样本量效应），但不影响 K* 的质性判断。预测逻辑：\n      \n      128 tokens (1v2=0.6187):\n      - 128 tokens 约 80-100 个 word-level tokens，surprisal/diversity 特征的统计估计方差增大；\n      - Qwen-cont baseline (无长度限制, 实际约 200-300 tokens) 1v2=0.6114，\n        128 tokens 版本略高（0.6187）看似反直觉，但原因是：截短文本的前 128 tokens \n        包含更多 prompt-influenced content，depth signal 在开头更集中；\n      - CI lower=0.6089 距 θ=0.60 仅 +0.89pp，是三个长度中最边缘的但仍然 pass；\n      - 这是整个 best tier 中最紧张的单一数据点（位于 best 档 [0.605, 0.635] 范围内）。\n      \n      256 tokens (1v2=0.6347):\n      - 统计估计更稳定，AUC 提升 ~1.6pp vs 128；\n      - CI lower=0.6251，margin 充裕（+2.5pp above θ）；\n      - 接近 Qwen-cont baseline 加上 length standardization 的增益。\n      \n      512 tokens (1v2=0.6523):\n      - 最长文本，特征估计最精确；\n      - AUC 接近 Pythia-1.4B baseline (0.6539)——同一 scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 在更长文本上\n        能更充分表征 depth-dependent 统计偏移；\n      - CI lower=0.6428，距 θ 有 +4.3pp margin，最稳健。\n      \n      单调递增模式（128 < 256 < 512）的机理：更长文本提供更多 token-level 观测值，\n      使 15D 特征的点估计更精确、fold-level 方差更小，但所有三个长度都保持 K*=2 \n      因为 depth signal 的存在性不依赖于样本量——只是检测功效 (power) 随样本量增加。\n      关键：即使在 128 tokens 这一极短条件下，K*=2 仍然成立，\n      说明 depth signal 不是长距离相关结构的产物，而是局部统计量的根本偏移。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Length Ablation: K* Stability Across Text Lengths\"\n        columns: [length, AUC_0v1, AUC_1v2, 1v2_CI_lower, AUC_2v3, 2v3_CI_upper, K_star]\n        rows:\n          - [\"128 tokens\", 0.9823, 0.6187, 0.6089, 0.5512, 0.5613, 2]\n          - [\"256 tokens\", 0.9948, 0.6347, 0.6251, 0.5578, 0.5678, 2]\n          - [\"512 tokens\", 0.9981, 0.6523, 0.6428, 0.5641, 0.5740, 2]\n      - title: \"Length Effect Decomposition\"\n        columns: [comparison, delta_AUC_1v2, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"128→256 (+2x)\", \"+0.0160\", \"estimation precision gain\"]\n          - [\"256→512 (+2x)\", \"+0.0176\", \"consistent ~0.017/doubling\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三面板 AUC decay curves (128/256/512)，展示 K*=2 boundary 在所有长度下的一致性，辅以 CI band\"\n      - \"AUC 1v2 vs log(length) 线性拟合图，展示 per-doubling 增益的恒定性\"\n    analysis: |\n      3/3 lengths K*=2 排除了 \"K*=2 是长文本特有现象\" 的替代解释。\n      128 tokens 是实际应用中常见的短文本长度（tweets, comments, abstracts），\n      K*=2 在此条件下成立使 practical deployment 更可信。\n      AUC 的单调递增是纯统计效应（更多观测→更精确估计），\n      而非 depth signal 的质性变化——这一区分在 Discussion 中很重要，\n      因为它意味着 K* 是文本的内在属性而非测量工具的 artifact。\n      论文可写：\"K*=2 is invariant to text length (128–512 tokens), \n      though detection power increases monotonically with length (~0.017 AUC per doubling).\"\n\n  - name: \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: \"4 generators (Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base) × 4 scorers (Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B, OLMo-1B, LLaMA-8B), 验证 scorer independence\"\n    expected_results:\n      matrix_size: \"4×4 = 16 cells\"\n      k_star_2_count: 15\n      k_star_2_fraction: 0.9375\n      k_star_1_cells: [\"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer\"]\n      auc_1v2_matrix:\n        Qwen_cont_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6112\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6078\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6034\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6156\n        Pythia_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6539\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6587\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6312\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6423\n        OLMo_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6146\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6089\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5978\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6067\n        Qwen_base_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6260\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6198\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6045\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6217\n      ci_lower_matrix:\n        Qwen_cont_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6015\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.5981\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5937\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6059\n        Pythia_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6454\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6492\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6215\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6328\n        OLMo_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6045\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.5992\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5881\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.5968\n        Qwen_base_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6168\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6101\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5948\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6120\n      cells_below_theta:\n        count: 1\n        details: \"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer: CI lower=0.5881 < 0.60 → K*=1\"\n      scorer_effect_anova_p: 0.23\n      generator_effect_anova_p: 0.001\n      interaction_effect_p: 0.41\n      feature_importance_cross_scorer_spearman_mean: 0.91\n    result_rationale: |\n      Cross-scorer matrix 的核心问题：当 scorer model ≠ generator model 时，\n      15D 特征中 surprisal-based features 的计算基础改变。预测逻辑：\n      \n      整体模式——generator 效应 >> scorer 效应：\n      - ANOVA 显示 generator identity (p=0.001) 是 AUC 的主驱动因素，\n        scorer identity (p=0.23) 不显著，交互效应 (p=0.41) 不显著；\n      - 这与 exp-013 的 \"depth signal ≈ 70-85% text-intrinsic\" 结论一致；\n      - 15D 特征中 7 个非 surprisal 特征（ttr, hapax, freq_*）完全 scorer-independent，\n        8 个 surprisal 特征虽依赖 scorer，但跨 scorer 的相对排序高度稳定 (ρ=0.91)。\n      \n      15/16 cells K*=2 的理由：\n      - 大多数 scorer 在计算 surprisal 时提供的是\"另一个模型对文本难度的估计\"，\n        这一估计虽然绝对值不同，但对 depth-dependent 变化的相对敏感度相似；\n      - Pythia 生成的文本在所有 4 个 scorer 下都给出最高 1v2 AUC (0.631-0.659)，\n        因为 Pythia 的 depth signal 最强（text-intrinsic component 最大）。\n      \n      唯一 K*=1 cell (OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer, CI lower=0.5881) 的解释：\n      - OLMo 生成的文本本身 depth signal 最弱（exp-002 baseline 1v2=0.6146，所有模型中最低）；\n      - OLMo 作为 scorer 时，对自己生成的文本计算 surprisal 会产生 self-familiarity 效应，\n        但方向相反——OLMo 对自己文本的 surprisal 更低且更均匀，\n        反而*抹平*了 depth-dependent 的 surprisal 变化；\n      - 这与 exp_A_alt_scorer 中观察到的 cross-scorer K* 降级模式一致\n        （olmo_qwen_cont: K*=1, AUC=0.5858），但原因不同：\n        exp_A 中是 Qwen-cont 数据的 signal 本身弱 + cross-scorer 噪声；\n        这里是 OLMo 数据的 signal 弱 + self-scorer 的 surprisal 均匀化效应。\n      \n      best 档下 15/16=93.75% K*=2 的合理性：\n      - 处于 [0.85, 1.0] 范围内的上半段；\n      - 唯一失败的 cell 有清晰的机制解释，不影响 universality claim；\n      - 论文可以 frame 为 \"scorer independence holds except in the degenerate case \n        where the weakest-signal generator is scored by itself.\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"4×4 Cross-Scorer AUC 1v2 Matrix\"\n        columns: [generator↓ / scorer→, Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B, OLMo-1B, LLaMA-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-cont\", 0.6112, 0.6078, 0.6034, 0.6156]\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B\", 0.6539, 0.6587, 0.6312, 0.6423]\n          - [\"OLMo-1B\", 0.6146, 0.6089, \"**0.5978**\", 0.6067]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", 0.6260, 0.6198, 0.6045, 0.6217]\n      - title: \"ANOVA: Sources of Variation in 1v2 AUC\"\n        columns: [source, F_stat, p_value, eta_squared, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [generator, 12.7, 0.001, 0.68, \"dominant factor\"]\n          - [scorer, 1.89, 0.23, 0.11, \"not significant\"]\n          - [interaction, 0.73, 0.41, 0.04, \"not significant\"]\n          - [residual, \"—\", \"—\", 0.17, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4×4 heatmap: AUC 1v2 值，颜色从蓝 (0.59) 到红 (0.66)，唯一冷色 cell 标注为 K*=1\"\n      - \"Scorer 效应 box plot: 每个 scorer 对应 4 个 generator 的 AUC 分布，展示 scorer 间差异远小于 generator 间差异\"\n    analysis: |\n      15/16 (93.75%) cells K*=2 确认 scorer independence：K* 主要由 generator 决定，\n      scorer 选择仅引入 ~1-2pp AUC 波动。\n      唯一例外 (OLMo×OLMo, K*=1) 是 weakest-signal generator + self-scorer 的 degenerate case。\n      ANOVA 定量确认 generator 贡献 68% 方差 vs scorer 11%。\n      \n      对论文的影响：\n      (1) Universality claim 加强——K*=2 不仅跨 generator model 稳定，也跨 scorer model 稳定；\n      (2) Practical implication：部署时可使用任意可用 LLM 作为 scorer，无需匹配 generator；\n      (3) LLaMA-8B 作为 scorer 给出的 AUC 普遍略高于小模型 scorers（列均值 +1.3pp），\n          提示更大的 scorer 能更精确估计 surprisal，但差异不影响 K* 判断；\n      (4) Limitation 措辞：\"In the degenerate case where generator and scorer coincide \n          and the text-intrinsic signal is weakest (OLMo-1B), K* may drop to 1 due to \n          surprisal homogenization. We recommend using a scorer ≠ generator in deployment.\"\n      \n      条件总数更新：\n      原 10 conditions + exp-018 (1) + exp-019 (1) + exp-020 (4) + exp-021 (3) + exp-022 中新增 conditions\n      = 10 + 2 + 4 + 3 + 考虑去重后 = 18 unique conditions (其中 17 K*=2, 1 K*=1)。\n      论文 headline: \"17/18 conditions K*=2 (94%), with the single exception attributable \n      to a degenerate self-scorer configuration.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32859,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32859},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4687266-61b1-45d0-b7ec-b9aba0d6e720","uuid":"c1e52e08-fa51-489d-b9d9-a59e5936daf4"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":221501,"duration_api_ms":223347,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"K*=2 universality 从 '10 conditions, 4 families, 1B-7B' 升级为 '18 conditions, 6 families, 1B-8B'。LLaMA-8B 和 Mistral-7B 的加入直接消解 Reviewer concern #1（小模型外推），Pythia decoding ablation 证明解码不变性跨模型成立，length ablation 排除文本长度混淆，cross-scorer matrix 确认 scorer independence。C1' 措辞升级为 'demonstrating universality across 6 architecture families at 1B-8B scale'。EMNLP Main 高置信投稿。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-018\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9587\n        1v2: 0.6341\n        2v3: 0.5523\n        3v4: 0.5198\n        4v5: 0.5072\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0041\n        1v2: 0.0088\n        2v3: 0.0055\n        3v4: 0.0097\n        4v5: 0.0063\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9587, ci_lower: 0.9551, ci_upper: 0.9621, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6341, ci_lower: 0.6253, ci_upper: 0.6428, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5523, ci_lower: 0.5419, ci_upper: 0.5627, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5198, ci_lower: 0.5092, ci_upper: 0.5303, perm_p: 0.0003}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5072, ci_lower: 0.4968, ci_upper: 0.5178, perm_p: 0.0891}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.118934\n        1v2: 0.011287\n        2v3: 0.005102\n        3v4: 0.004213\n        4v5: 0.003089\n      ordinal_mae: 1.1982\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3587\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_mean, surp_d1_skew]\n      n_samples: 30000\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: |\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA 和 RoPE，架构与 Qwen2.5 系同属 decoder-only transformer 但训练数据和 tokenizer 差异显著。\n      1v2 AUC=0.6341 处于 best 档 [0.615, 0.655] 中偏上位置，理由：\n      (1) 8B 参数量使模型能更精确地复制输入分布，gen-1 与 gen-0 的统计距离缩小，但 DPI 信息损失仍可检测；\n      (2) Cross-scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 对 LLaMA 文本计算 surprisal 时，tokenizer 不匹配引入轻微噪声，\n          但这仅增加方差（std=0.0088）而非系统性偏差——exp-004 (Qwen-7B, 同一 scorer) 给出 0.6178，\n          LLaMA-8B 稍高是因为 LLaMA 的 BPE 与 Qwen scorer 的 token boundary 不完全对齐，\n          跨 tokenizer 的 surprisal 分布差异恰好放大了 depth-dependent 特征的区分度；\n      (3) 0v1 AUC=0.9587 略低于 Qwen-7B 的 0.9644，原因同上——cross-tokenizer 噪声使 binary detection 微降，\n          但仍远高于 θ=0.60；\n      (4) 2v3 CI upper=0.5627 < 0.60，K*=2 边界清晰，不像 Qwen-cont 那样边缘；\n      (5) 4v5 pair perm_p=0.0891 > 0.05，与 exp-004 模式一致（深代际趋向随机）。\n      总结：LLaMA-8B 作为第 5 个架构族在 8B 规模确认 K*=2，CI lower=0.6253 距 θ=0.60 有 +2.5pp margin，\n      比 Qwen-cont (0.6015, +0.15pp) 稳健得多，直接强化 universality claim。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap 95% CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, AUC, CI_lower, CI_upper, perm_p, K_star_pass]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9587, 0.9551, 0.9621, \"<0.001\", \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6341, 0.6253, 0.6428, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_lower > 0.60\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5523, 0.5419, 0.5627, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_upper < 0.60\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5198, 0.5092, 0.5303, \"<0.001\", \"—\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5072, 0.4968, 0.5178, \"0.089\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: LLaMA-8B 叠加在已有 5 模型曲线上，展示相同的 0v1→1v2 急剧衰减 + 2v3 以后 plateau 模式\"\n    analysis: |\n      LLaMA-8B 是论文中最大模型且来自 Meta 架构族（区别于 EleutherAI/AI2/Alibaba）。\n      K*=2 在 8B 的确认将 scale coverage 从 '1B-7B' 升级为 '1B-8B'，\n      architecture coverage 从 4 families 升级为 5 families。\n      CI lower=0.6253 提供了比 Qwen-7B (0.6079) 更充裕的 margin，\n      使得整体 universality claim 对 θ 选择更鲁棒（即使 θ 上移到 0.62，LLaMA-8B 仍然 pass）。\n      Cross-tokenizer scorer 的成功也间接支持 exp-013 的 text-intrinsic signal 结论。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-019\"\n    description: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9612\n        1v2: 0.6278\n        2v3: 0.5489\n        3v4: 0.5167\n        4v5: 0.5054\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0038\n        1v2: 0.0076\n        2v3: 0.0048\n        3v4: 0.0102\n        4v5: 0.0071\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9612, ci_lower: 0.9578, ci_upper: 0.9645, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6278, ci_lower: 0.6195, ci_upper: 0.6362, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5489, ci_lower: 0.5387, ci_upper: 0.5591, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5167, ci_lower: 0.5059, ci_upper: 0.5274, perm_p: 0.0008}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5054, ci_lower: 0.4948, ci_upper: 0.5162, perm_p: 0.1243}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.121587\n        1v2: 0.010834\n        2v3: 0.004921\n        3v4: 0.003876\n        4v5: 0.002918\n      ordinal_mae: 1.2078\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3542\n      top_features: [surp_d1_std, freq_entropy, surp_std, surp_d1_mean, surp_skew]\n      n_samples: 30000\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096) + GQA，\n      与 LLaMA 的 full attention 和 Qwen 的 结构有本质差异。\n      1v2 AUC=0.6278 处于 best 档 [0.61, 0.645] 中部，略低于 LLaMA-8B (0.6341)，理由：\n      (1) Mistral 的 SWA 使长距离依赖信息在递归生成中的损失模式不同——\n          SWA 内的局部统计特征（surprisal 局部分布）在代际间退化稍快，\n          但全局特征（freq_entropy, ttr）退化模式与其他架构一致；\n      (2) Mistral 7B 参数量略少于 LLaMA 8B，信息保持能力的微小差异反映在 +0.63pp 的 AUC 差距；\n      (3) Cross-scorer tokenizer 效应与 LLaMA 类似但 Mistral 的 byte-fallback BPE \n          使 surprisal 计算的 token-boundary 差异更稳定，方差略低 (std=0.0076 vs 0.0088)；\n      (4) CI lower=0.6195 距 θ=0.60 有 +1.95pp margin，稳健通过；\n      (5) 2v3 CI upper=0.5591 < 0.60，K*=2 边界明确；\n      (6) 4v5 perm_p=0.1243，深代际不可分辨，与全部先前实验一致。\n      Mistral 作为第 6 个架构族（唯一的 SWA 架构），确认 K*=2 不依赖于 attention 机制选择，\n      进一步强化 \"architecture-invariant\" 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap 95% CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, AUC, CI_lower, CI_upper, perm_p, K_star_pass]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9612, 0.9578, 0.9645, \"<0.001\", \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6278, 0.6195, 0.6362, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_lower > 0.60\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5489, 0.5387, 0.5591, \"<0.001\", \"✅ CI_upper < 0.60\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5167, 0.5059, 0.5274, \"<0.001\", \"—\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5054, 0.4948, 0.5162, \"0.124\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"6-model AUC decay overlay: 所有 6 个模型族的 pairwise AUC 衰减曲线在同一图上，展示 1v2→2v3 处的 universal cliff\"\n    analysis: |\n      Mistral-7B 的 SWA 架构是唯一非 full-attention 模型。K*=2 在 SWA 下成立表明：\n      depth signal 的退化不依赖于模型如何 attend to 长距离 context，\n      而是 iterated generation 本身对局部统计量的 lossy compression 所致。\n      这与 DPI 框架完美一致——channel 的具体实现（SWA vs full attn）不影响信息损失的定性行为。\n      结合 LLaMA-8B，两个 7-8B 模型的一致结果使 reviewer concern #1 彻底失效。\n\n  - name: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      k_star_all_configs: true\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        config1_greedy:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9718, ci: [0.9691, 0.9744], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6482, ci: [0.6391, 0.6573], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5538, ci: [0.5441, 0.5635], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5189, ci: [0.5083, 0.5295], perm_p: 0.0002}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5098, ci: [0.4991, 0.5205], perm_p: 0.0312}\n        config2_nuc09:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9901, ci: [0.9886, 0.9916], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6512, ci: [0.6422, 0.6602], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5567, ci: [0.5469, 0.5665], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5201, ci: [0.5096, 0.5307], perm_p: 0.0001}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5112, ci: [0.5005, 0.5219], perm_p: 0.0198}\n        config3_t07:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9812, ci: [0.9789, 0.9835], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6498, ci: [0.6407, 0.6589], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5551, ci: [0.5453, 0.5649], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5178, ci: [0.5072, 0.5284], perm_p: 0.0003}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5134, ci: [0.5027, 0.5241], perm_p: 0.0087}\n        config4_t12:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9962, ci: [0.9953, 0.9970], perm_p: 0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6671, ci: [0.6579, 0.6763], perm_p: 0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5623, ci: [0.5524, 0.5722], perm_p: 0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5215, ci: [0.5108, 0.5322], perm_p: 0.0001}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5147, ci: [0.5040, 0.5254], perm_p: 0.0052}\n      auc_1v2_range: [0.6482, 0.6671]\n      auc_1v2_spread: 0.0189\n      cross_decoding_feature_spearman: 0.87\n      method: \"GroupKFold(5) OOF + doc-level bootstrap + label permutation\"\n      resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: |\n      exp-003 在 Qwen2.5-1.5B 上已证明 4/4 decoding strategies K*=2，1v2 range=[0.6866, 0.7039]。\n      Pythia-1.4B 基准 1v2=0.6539 (nucleus p=0.95, exp-001)，预测 4 种解码的 1v2 range=[0.6482, 0.6671]：\n      (1) Greedy (0.6482): 确定性解码减少输出多样性，gen-1 更接近\"平均化\"的文本，\n          相比 nucleus 0.95 的 0.6539 略低，因为 greedy 的低熵输出使 surprisal 方差特征的区分度微降；\n      (2) Nucleus p=0.9 (0.6512): 接近 baseline 的 p=0.95，差异极小；\n      (3) T=0.7 (0.6498): 低温采样与 greedy 类似，轻微压缩分布尾部；\n      (4) T=1.2 (0.6671): 高温增加输出多样性，gen-1 文本的统计特征偏离更明显，\n          1v2 区分度升高——与 exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高 AUC (0.7039) 的模式完全一致；\n      (5) Range=0.0189 << Qwen 的 0.0173，说明 Pythia 对解码策略的敏感度与 Qwen 量级相当；\n      (6) 所有 4 个 config 的 CI lower 均 > 0.639，远高于 θ=0.60，margin 充裕；\n      (7) 所有 2v3 CI upper < 0.5722 < 0.60，K*=2 边界在所有 config 下清晰；\n      (8) Cross-decoding feature importance Spearman=0.87，高于 exp-003 中 Qwen 的\n          greedy vs T=1.2 的 0.53——Pythia 架构下特征排序对解码策略更稳定。\n      \n      关键意义：这证明 decoding invariance 不是 Qwen-specific 现象，而是跨模型成立的。\n      exp-003 (Qwen) + exp-020 (Pythia) 合计 8 个 decoding configurations 全部 K*=2。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Pythia-1.4B Decoding Ablation Summary\"\n        columns: [decoding, AUC_1v2, CI_lower, CI_upper, AUC_2v3, 2v3_CI_upper, K_star]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.6482, 0.6391, 0.6573, 0.5538, 0.5635, 2]\n          - [\"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6512, 0.6422, 0.6602, 0.5567, 0.5665, 2]\n          - [\"T=0.7\", 0.6498, 0.6407, 0.6589, 0.5551, 0.5649, 2]\n          - [\"T=1.2\", 0.6671, 0.6579, 0.6763, 0.5623, 0.5722, 2]\n      - title: \"Cross-model Decoding Invariance Comparison\"\n        columns: [model, decoding_configs, 1v2_range, range_width, all_K_star_2]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-1.5B (exp-003)\", 4, \"[0.6866, 0.7039]\", 0.0173, \"✅\"]\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B (exp-020)\", 4, \"[0.6482, 0.6671]\", 0.0189, \"✅\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双模型 decoding heatmap: Qwen (exp-003) 和 Pythia (exp-020) 各 4 decoding × 5 depth pairs 的 AUC，颜色编码展示两个模型的平行结构\"\n    analysis: |\n      Pythia 4/4 decoding configs K*=2 确认 decoding invariance 是跨模型的普遍现象。\n      论文 claim 从 \"4 decoding strategies (single model)\" 升级为 \"8 decoding configurations across 2 models\"。\n      T=1.2 在两个模型上都给出最高 1v2 AUC（Qwen 0.7039, Pythia 0.6671），\n      机制一致：高温采样放大 next-token 分布的尾部，使 gen-1 的 surprisal 分布特征更显著偏离 gen-0。\n      但即便如此，2v3 仍然 < 0.60——DPI 的信息饱和在 K*=2 处仍然成立。\n      Feature importance Spearman=0.87 (cross-decoding within Pythia) 高于 0.53 (cross-decoding within Qwen, exp-003)，\n      说明 Pythia 的特征排序对解码策略更稳定，可能因为 Pythia 架构更简单（无 GQA/RoPE enhancements）。\n\n  - name: \"Text length ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star_all_lengths: 2\n      results_by_length:\n        128_tokens:\n          k_star: 2\n          pairwise_auc:\n            0v1: 0.9823\n            1v2: 0.6187\n            2v3: 0.5512\n            3v4: 0.5298\n            4v5: 0.5089\n          bootstrap_ci:\n            1v2: {auc: 0.6187, ci_lower: 0.6089, ci_upper: 0.6285, perm_p: 0.0001}\n            2v3: {auc: 0.5512, ci_lower: 0.5411, ci_upper: 0.5613, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          ordinal_mae: 1.2134\n          ordinal_accuracy: 0.3612\n        256_tokens:\n          k_star: 2\n          pairwise_auc:\n            0v1: 0.9948\n            1v2: 0.6347\n            2v3: 0.5578\n            3v4: 0.5342\n            4v5: 0.5118\n          bootstrap_ci:\n            1v2: {auc: 0.6347, ci_lower: 0.6251, ci_upper: 0.6443, perm_p: 0.0001}\n            2v3: {auc: 0.5578, ci_lower: 0.5478, ci_upper: 0.5678, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          ordinal_mae: 1.1723\n          ordinal_accuracy: 0.3756\n        512_tokens:\n          k_star: 2\n          pairwise_auc:\n            0v1: 0.9981\n            1v2: 0.6523\n            2v3: 0.5641\n            3v4: 0.5378\n            4v5: 0.5145\n          bootstrap_ci:\n            1v2: {auc: 0.6523, ci_lower: 0.6428, ci_upper: 0.6618, perm_p: 0.0001}\n            2v3: {auc: 0.5641, ci_lower: 0.5542, ci_upper: 0.5740, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          ordinal_mae: 1.1389\n          ordinal_accuracy: 0.3891\n      auc_1v2_vs_length_spearman: 1.0\n      length_effect_per_doubling: \"+0.016 AUC per 2x tokens\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      文本长度影响特征估计的精度（样本量效应），但不影响 K* 的质性判断。预测逻辑：\n      \n      128 tokens (1v2=0.6187):\n      - 128 tokens 约 80-100 个 word-level tokens，surprisal/diversity 特征的统计估计方差增大；\n      - Qwen-cont baseline (无长度限制, 实际约 200-300 tokens) 1v2=0.6114，\n        128 tokens 版本略高（0.6187）看似反直觉，但原因是：截短文本的前 128 tokens \n        包含更多 prompt-influenced content，depth signal 在开头更集中；\n      - CI lower=0.6089 距 θ=0.60 仅 +0.89pp，是三个长度中最边缘的但仍然 pass；\n      - 这是整个 best tier 中最紧张的单一数据点（位于 best 档 [0.605, 0.635] 范围内）。\n      \n      256 tokens (1v2=0.6347):\n      - 统计估计更稳定，AUC 提升 ~1.6pp vs 128；\n      - CI lower=0.6251，margin 充裕（+2.5pp above θ）；\n      - 接近 Qwen-cont baseline 加上 length standardization 的增益。\n      \n      512 tokens (1v2=0.6523):\n      - 最长文本，特征估计最精确；\n      - AUC 接近 Pythia-1.4B baseline (0.6539)——同一 scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 在更长文本上\n        能更充分表征 depth-dependent 统计偏移；\n      - CI lower=0.6428，距 θ 有 +4.3pp margin，最稳健。\n      \n      单调递增模式（128 < 256 < 512）的机理：更长文本提供更多 token-level 观测值，\n      使 15D 特征的点估计更精确、fold-level 方差更小，但所有三个长度都保持 K*=2 \n      因为 depth signal 的存在性不依赖于样本量——只是检测功效 (power) 随样本量增加。\n      关键：即使在 128 tokens 这一极短条件下，K*=2 仍然成立，\n      说明 depth signal 不是长距离相关结构的产物，而是局部统计量的根本偏移。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Length Ablation: K* Stability Across Text Lengths\"\n        columns: [length, AUC_0v1, AUC_1v2, 1v2_CI_lower, AUC_2v3, 2v3_CI_upper, K_star]\n        rows:\n          - [\"128 tokens\", 0.9823, 0.6187, 0.6089, 0.5512, 0.5613, 2]\n          - [\"256 tokens\", 0.9948, 0.6347, 0.6251, 0.5578, 0.5678, 2]\n          - [\"512 tokens\", 0.9981, 0.6523, 0.6428, 0.5641, 0.5740, 2]\n      - title: \"Length Effect Decomposition\"\n        columns: [comparison, delta_AUC_1v2, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"128→256 (+2x)\", \"+0.0160\", \"estimation precision gain\"]\n          - [\"256→512 (+2x)\", \"+0.0176\", \"consistent ~0.017/doubling\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三面板 AUC decay curves (128/256/512)，展示 K*=2 boundary 在所有长度下的一致性，辅以 CI band\"\n      - \"AUC 1v2 vs log(length) 线性拟合图，展示 per-doubling 增益的恒定性\"\n    analysis: |\n      3/3 lengths K*=2 排除了 \"K*=2 是长文本特有现象\" 的替代解释。\n      128 tokens 是实际应用中常见的短文本长度（tweets, comments, abstracts），\n      K*=2 在此条件下成立使 practical deployment 更可信。\n      AUC 的单调递增是纯统计效应（更多观测→更精确估计），\n      而非 depth signal 的质性变化——这一区分在 Discussion 中很重要，\n      因为它意味着 K* 是文本的内在属性而非测量工具的 artifact。\n      论文可写：\"K*=2 is invariant to text length (128–512 tokens), \n      though detection power increases monotonically with length (~0.017 AUC per doubling).\"\n\n  - name: \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: \"4 generators (Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base) × 4 scorers (Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B, OLMo-1B, LLaMA-8B), 验证 scorer independence\"\n    expected_results:\n      matrix_size: \"4×4 = 16 cells\"\n      k_star_2_count: 15\n      k_star_2_fraction: 0.9375\n      k_star_1_cells: [\"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer\"]\n      auc_1v2_matrix:\n        Qwen_cont_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6112\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6078\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6034\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6156\n        Pythia_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6539\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6587\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6312\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6423\n        OLMo_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6146\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6089\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5978\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6067\n        Qwen_base_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6260\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6198\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6045\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6217\n      ci_lower_matrix:\n        Qwen_cont_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6015\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.5981\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5937\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6059\n        Pythia_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6454\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6492\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.6215\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6328\n        OLMo_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6045\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.5992\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5881\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.5968\n        Qwen_base_gen:\n          Qwen_scorer: 0.6168\n          Pythia_scorer: 0.6101\n          OLMo_scorer: 0.5948\n          LLaMA_scorer: 0.6120\n      cells_below_theta:\n        count: 1\n        details: \"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer: CI lower=0.5881 < 0.60 → K*=1\"\n      scorer_effect_anova_p: 0.23\n      generator_effect_anova_p: 0.001\n      interaction_effect_p: 0.41\n      feature_importance_cross_scorer_spearman_mean: 0.91\n    result_rationale: |\n      Cross-scorer matrix 的核心问题：当 scorer model ≠ generator model 时，\n      15D 特征中 surprisal-based features 的计算基础改变。预测逻辑：\n      \n      整体模式——generator 效应 >> scorer 效应：\n      - ANOVA 显示 generator identity (p=0.001) 是 AUC 的主驱动因素，\n        scorer identity (p=0.23) 不显著，交互效应 (p=0.41) 不显著；\n      - 这与 exp-013 的 \"depth signal ≈ 70-85% text-intrinsic\" 结论一致；\n      - 15D 特征中 7 个非 surprisal 特征（ttr, hapax, freq_*）完全 scorer-independent，\n        8 个 surprisal 特征虽依赖 scorer，但跨 scorer 的相对排序高度稳定 (ρ=0.91)。\n      \n      15/16 cells K*=2 的理由：\n      - 大多数 scorer 在计算 surprisal 时提供的是\"另一个模型对文本难度的估计\"，\n        这一估计虽然绝对值不同，但对 depth-dependent 变化的相对敏感度相似；\n      - Pythia 生成的文本在所有 4 个 scorer 下都给出最高 1v2 AUC (0.631-0.659)，\n        因为 Pythia 的 depth signal 最强（text-intrinsic component 最大）。\n      \n      唯一 K*=1 cell (OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer, CI lower=0.5881) 的解释：\n      - OLMo 生成的文本本身 depth signal 最弱（exp-002 baseline 1v2=0.6146，所有模型中最低）；\n      - OLMo 作为 scorer 时，对自己生成的文本计算 surprisal 会产生 self-familiarity 效应，\n        但方向相反——OLMo 对自己文本的 surprisal 更低且更均匀，\n        反而*抹平*了 depth-dependent 的 surprisal 变化；\n      - 这与 exp_A_alt_scorer 中观察到的 cross-scorer K* 降级模式一致\n        （olmo_qwen_cont: K*=1, AUC=0.5858），但原因不同：\n        exp_A 中是 Qwen-cont 数据的 signal 本身弱 + cross-scorer 噪声；\n        这里是 OLMo 数据的 signal 弱 + self-scorer 的 surprisal 均匀化效应。\n      \n      best 档下 15/16=93.75% K*=2 的合理性：\n      - 处于 [0.85, 1.0] 范围内的上半段；\n      - 唯一失败的 cell 有清晰的机制解释，不影响 universality claim；\n      - 论文可以 frame 为 \"scorer independence holds except in the degenerate case \n        where the weakest-signal generator is scored by itself.\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"4×4 Cross-Scorer AUC 1v2 Matrix\"\n        columns: [generator↓ / scorer→, Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B, OLMo-1B, LLaMA-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-cont\", 0.6112, 0.6078, 0.6034, 0.6156]\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B\", 0.6539, 0.6587, 0.6312, 0.6423]\n          - [\"OLMo-1B\", 0.6146, 0.6089, \"**0.5978**\", 0.6067]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", 0.6260, 0.6198, 0.6045, 0.6217]\n      - title: \"ANOVA: Sources of Variation in 1v2 AUC\"\n        columns: [source, F_stat, p_value, eta_squared, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [generator, 12.7, 0.001, 0.68, \"dominant factor\"]\n          - [scorer, 1.89, 0.23, 0.11, \"not significant\"]\n          - [interaction, 0.73, 0.41, 0.04, \"not significant\"]\n          - [residual, \"—\", \"—\", 0.17, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4×4 heatmap: AUC 1v2 值，颜色从蓝 (0.59) 到红 (0.66)，唯一冷色 cell 标注为 K*=1\"\n      - \"Scorer 效应 box plot: 每个 scorer 对应 4 个 generator 的 AUC 分布，展示 scorer 间差异远小于 generator 间差异\"\n    analysis: |\n      15/16 (93.75%) cells K*=2 确认 scorer independence：K* 主要由 generator 决定，\n      scorer 选择仅引入 ~1-2pp AUC 波动。\n      唯一例外 (OLMo×OLMo, K*=1) 是 weakest-signal generator + self-scorer 的 degenerate case。\n      ANOVA 定量确认 generator 贡献 68% 方差 vs scorer 11%。\n      \n      对论文的影响：\n      (1) Universality claim 加强——K*=2 不仅跨 generator model 稳定，也跨 scorer model 稳定；\n      (2) Practical implication：部署时可使用任意可用 LLM 作为 scorer，无需匹配 generator；\n      (3) LLaMA-8B 作为 scorer 给出的 AUC 普遍略高于小模型 scorers（列均值 +1.3pp），\n          提示更大的 scorer 能更精确估计 surprisal，但差异不影响 K* 判断；\n      (4) Limitation 措辞：\"In the degenerate case where generator and scorer coincide \n          and the text-intrinsic signal is weakest (OLMo-1B), K* may drop to 1 due to \n          surprisal homogenization. We recommend using a scorer ≠ generator in deployment.\"\n      \n      条件总数更新：\n      原 10 conditions + exp-018 (1) + exp-019 (1) + exp-020 (4) + exp-021 (3) + exp-022 中新增 conditions\n      = 10 + 2 + 4 + 3 + 考虑去重后 = 18 unique conditions (其中 17 K*=2, 1 K*=1)。\n      论文 headline: \"17/18 conditions K*=2 (94%), with the single exception attributable \n      to a degenerate self-scorer configuration.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a4687266-61b1-45d0-b7ec-b9aba0d6e720","total_cost_usd":0.55539525,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32859,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12643,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12643,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":27816,"outputTokens":41,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028021,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12643,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":32859,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.52737425,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"299932a5-27f6-4e6e-b1b4-b3f26ded175b"}
